Place the following image files in this directory:

HERO SECTION (3 images):
1. hero-bg-photo.jpg - Aerial desert photo background (50% opacity layer)
2. hero-bg-texture.jpg - Full-frame texture overlay
3. hero-divider-line.png - Red+white decorative rule at section bottom

CONTACT FORM SECTION (2 images):
4. contact-mascot.png - DA Motorsports skull/rider mascot illustration (198×165)
5. contact-divider-line.png - Red+white section rule below "REACH OUT" heading

TESTIMONIAL SECTION (5 images):
6. testimonial-bg-texture.jpg - Light section background texture (20% opacity)
7. testimonial-avatar.jpg - Reviewer avatar photo (48×48)
8. testimonial-stars.svg - Five-star rating graphic (116×19)
9. testimonial-arrow-prev.svg - Left arrow icon for slider prev button
10. testimonial-arrow-next.svg - Right arrow icon for slider next button

CTA SECTION (3 images):
11. cta-bg-photo.jpg - Background motorcycle wheel photo
12. cta-bg-texture.jpg - Texture overlay (sits above dark overlay)
13. cta-divider-line.png - Red+white rule below CTA heading

Total: 13 images required

These files are referenced in the HTML comments at the top of index.html with their Figma asset IDs.
